*
!.gitignore

# Everything here is ignored by default. Only two projects are tracked, and a
# new project stays local unless it is added below on purpose.
#
#   default             the shipped Cortex Ignition build (formerly
#                       cortex-ignition-tech-demo-0.4b) and the New Project
#                       template. Its project.ron is include_str!'d into
#                       psxed-project and its starter assets seed every new
#                       project, so the build needs it on disk.
#   quake-e1m1-geometry brush/workspace test fixture
#
# Superseded level projects (0.2, 0.3, 0.4, null-choir-texture-kit, mantis,
# tech-demo) and in-progress ones (cortex-ignition-0.5) are local-only, same
# arrangement as editor/archive/legacy-grid/.
!default/
!default/**
!quake-e1m1-geometry/
!quake-e1m1-geometry/**
# The per-user editor view file inside a tracked project stays local.
**/.psxed-view.ron

# Animation-generation auditions and review renders are local working inputs.
# Cooked runtime clips under assets/animations remain tracked.
default/source_assets/**/animations/candidates/
default/source_assets/**/animations/previews/
default/source_assets/**/previews/
**/cooked/
**/baked/
**/logs/
# Emulator/editor screen grabs: working output, regenerated on demand.
**/captures/
